From 8765edc2b5564d59e40187d57e91fd75b7352653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Aug 2024 19:51:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/53] swdtb: add inject node and global pool to reserved
 memory (#105)

1. swdtb: inject: add inject node to reserved memory
2. swdtb: global_pool: add DMA global pool to reserved memory

*Add inject node to reserved memory
Add the inject node to the reserved-memory node.
If the reserved-memory node is absent, it will be created as part of this
fix.

Example:
reserved-memory {
	#address-cells = <0x02>;
	#size-cells = <0x02>;
	ranges;
	andes_inject@100000 {
		compatible = "inject";
		reg = <0x00 0x100000 0x00 0x100000>;
		reusable;
	};
};

*Add DMA global pool to reserved memory:
Add the DMA global pool node to the reserved-memory node.
If the reserved-memory node does not exist, it will be created as part of
this fix.

Example:
reserved-memory {
	#address-cells = <0x02>;
	#size-cells = <0x02>;
	ranges;
	dma_global_pool0@3e800000 {
		linux,dma-default;
		compatible = "shared-dma-pool";
		reg = <0x00 0x3e800000 0x00 0x200000>;
		phandle = <0x06>;
		no-map;
	};
};

Signed-off-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
